{"id":"b176dfebe3d3aef4","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-associative.md","title":"Associative","display":"df-associative — Associative","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-associative","aliases":["58-df-associative"],"display":"df-associative — Associative","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-associative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-associative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-associative — Associative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"788f4256d9b974d6\" href=\"?note=788f4256d9b974d6\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md\">../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*\\in V\">\\(*\\in V\\)</span> (candidate function graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinOp}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BinOp}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (binary-operation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"788f4256d9b974d6\" href=\"?note=788f4256d9b974d6\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md\">../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Associative}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Associative}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (associativity predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}associative} \\vdash \\mathrm{Associative}_S(A,*)\\leftrightarrow A\\in V\\land\\mathrm{BinOp}_S(*,A)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;\\bigl(*( *(x,y),z)=*(x,*(y,z))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}associative} \\vdash \\mathrm{Associative}_S(A,*)\\leftrightarrow A\\in V\\land\\mathrm{BinOp}_S(*,A)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;\\bigl(*( *(x,y),z)=*(x,*(y,z))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Associativity is the multiplication law used by semigroups, monoids, and groups.</li>\n<li>The binary-operation side condition uses the exact two-place upstream predicate; application notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*(x,y)\">\\(*(x,y)\\)</span> denotes evaluation of its function graph.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md","status":"resolved","id":"788f4256d9b974d6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md","status":"resolved","id":"788f4256d9b974d6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BinOp}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (binary-operation predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"*\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BinOp}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Associative}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}associative} \\vdash \\mathrm{Associative}_S(A,*)\\leftrightarrow A\\in V\\land\\mathrm{BinOp}_S(*,A)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;\\bigl(*( *(x,y),z)=*(x,*(y,z))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"*(x,y)","display":false}],"bytes":965,"backlinks":[{"id":"193137d919281dfb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Associative}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (associativity predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-associative.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-associative.md|58-df-associative]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["788f4256d9b974d6"]}